    "title": "How to live stream USA vs Venezuela: WBC Championship, TV channel",
    "text": "The United States will take on Venezuela in the 2026 World Baseball Classic championship game on Tuesday night, with first pitch set for 8 p.m. ET at loanDepot Park in Miami. The game will be broadcast on FOX, with streaming available on Fubo, as two of the tournament’s top teams battle for the title on baseball’s global stage. MORE: Team USA bringing Olympic gold medal swag to WBC championship pregame festivities Mar 4, 2026; Scottsdale, AZ, USA; United States right fielder Aaron Judge (99) and first baseman Bryce Harper (24) talk against the Colorado Rockies in the third inning at Salt River Fields. Mandatory Credit: Rick Scuteri-Imagn Images How to Watch USA vs Venezuela Date: Tuesday, March 17, 2026 Time: 8:00 PM ET TV Channel: FOX Live Stream: Fubo (try for free) Team USA enters the final after a strong run through the knockout stage, defeating Canada in the quarterfinals before edging the Dominican Republic in a tightly contested semifinal matchup. The victory sends the Americans to their third consecutive World Baseball Classic championship appearance, continuing a run of consistency on the international stage. The United States previously captured the WBC title in 2017 with a win over Puerto Rico, but fell short in the 2023 championship game at the same Miami venue, losing to Japan. Now, the Americans have another opportunity to lift the trophy on home soil. Venezuela, meanwhile, has put together one of the most impressive runs of the tournament. They advanced to the championship after rallying past Italy in the semifinal, highlighted by a decisive late-inning surge. Earlier in the knockout stage, Venezuela delivered one of the tournament’s biggest upsets by eliminating defending champion Japan, helping pave the way for their historic run. This marks Venezuela’s first-ever appearance in the World Baseball Classic final, as the team looks to secure its first championship against a U.S. squad aiming for its second title. The matchup features two star-studded rosters filled with Major League Baseball talent, setting the stage for a high-level showdown in front of what is expected to be a packed and energetic crowd in Miami. With a championship on the line, the United States will look to build on its recent success in the tournament, while Venezuela aims to complete a historic run and capture its first WBC crown. Fans can tune in live on FOX or stream the game on Fubo to catch all the action from the 2026 World Baseball Classic final. If you purchase a product or register for an account through one of the links on our site, we may receive compensation. — Enjoy free coverage of the top news & trending stories on The Big Lead — MARCH MADNESS: 6 March Madness Cinderellas, bracket-busters poised to destroy the field WORLD BASEBALL CLASSIC: Latest Mason Miller update could force Team USA to choose new WBC closer BRACKETOLOGY: Kalshi reveals $1 billion prize for March Madness perfect bracket NFL: Tom Brady’s Fanatics Flag Football Classic taps popular FOX broadcast duo NBA:Board of Governors holding vote to explore adding two expansion teams ENTERTAINMENT: Look inside the Oscars $350,000 gift bags for 2026 Academy Awards",
